@startuml kairos-view-department-details-sequence
title View Departments and Department Detail

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Departments Overview
WebAdmin -> API: GET /departments?branchId=...
API -> DB: SELECT departments
DB --> API: Departments list
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {departments}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click a department
WebAdmin -> API: GET /departments/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT department + members + leader + attendance summary
DB --> API: Department detail
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {detail}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render Department Detail

@enduml
